## 示例 CSS

```css
/* 重点词汇容器 */
.vocab-container {
  width: 100%;
  margin: 0 auto;
  font-family: Arial, "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
  color: #222;
}

/* 标题 */
.vocab-title {
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  color: #1f2937;
}

/* 表格 */
.vocab-table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  background: #fff;
  border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
  border-radius: 8px;
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
}

.vocab-table th,
.vocab-table td {
  padding: 10px 12px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
  text-align: left;
  font-size: 14px;
}

.vocab-table th {
  background: #f9fafb;
  color: #374151;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.vocab-table tr:hover {
  background: #f3f4f6;
}

/* lemma */
.col-lemma {
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #111827;
}

/* unit */
.col-unit {
  color: #2563eb;
  font-weight: 600;
}

/* page */
.col-page {
  color: #7c3aed;
}

/* frequency */
.col-frequency {
  text-align: center;
  font-weight: 700;
}

/* 频率高亮 */
.freq-high {
  color: #dc2626;
}

.freq-medium {
  color: #d97706;
}

.freq-low {
  color: #16a34a;
}

/* in_syllabus */
.syllabus-yes {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 4px 8px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: #dcfce7;
  color: #166534;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.syllabus-no {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 4px 8px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: #fee2e2;
  color: #991b1b;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 600;
}
```

